{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-24T00:14:12.182Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"grok-4.7","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"3f98104392d35363ff109b91","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"grok-4.7","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-24T00:14:12.180Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"With fetched tags, the unflagged generator matches the published ledger and omits 37 dependency bullets from release windows that already have tracked items. Passing --dependency-updates restores all 37 published dependency PRs: 8, 9, 13, 14, 15, 24, 35, 58, 72, 91, 97, 107, 108, 109, 116, 146, 153, 154, 159, 166, 174, 179, 181, 184, 185, 191, 200, 201, 202, 203, 212, 213, 221, 222, 227, 267, 299. Removing only the flag from the package scripts fails the changelog entry-point regression. Restoring the flag makes that test pass, 1/1."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-24T00:14:12.182Z"}],"before_hash":"07f818dc2d44c824ede0c9f0223203dd08746a7b2b21b138767b32efbcf05bf6","after_hash":"7afd74d99b4f8c779e4826755598da57c9c37870ccbc254e61d7ac926525ecec","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"59ab4981f06036cbcc9f69dea89103f766b7a636eee61fb1324e7afe6921b689"}
